{"title": "Letter from Voss", "pageid": 30052, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Letter_from_Voss", "categories": ["Slates", "Common items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">See also: <a href=\"/wiki/The_First_Protocol\" title=\"The First Protocol\">The First Protocol</a>        </div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Book_Stone_Disc_Image.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Book_Stone_Disc_Image.png/300px-Book_Stone_Disc_Image.png.webp, /w/images/b/b2/Book_Stone_Disc_Image.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Letter from Voss image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Book_Stone_Disc_Image.png/300px-Book_Stone_Disc_Image.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Book_Stone_Disc_Image.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Letter from Voss</b> is one of the letters the player character can receive in the <a href=\"/wiki/Epilogue\" title=\"Epilogue\">Epilogue</a>. It has two variations depending on whether <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Orpheus\" title=\"Orpheus\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e0/Portrait_Orpheus.png/25px-Portrait_Orpheus.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e0/Portrait_Orpheus.png/38px-Portrait_Orpheus.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e0/Portrait_Orpheus.png/50px-Portrait_Orpheus.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Orpheus\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e0/Portrait_Orpheus.png/25px-Portrait_Orpheus.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e0/Portrait_Orpheus.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Orpheus\" title=\"Orpheus\">Orpheus</a> survives the game as a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Githyanki\" title=\"Githyanki\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Race_Githyanki.png/25px-Race_Githyanki.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/af/Race_Githyanki.png/38px-Race_Githyanki.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/af/Race_Githyanki.png/50px-Race_Githyanki.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Githyanki\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Race_Githyanki.png/25px-Race_Githyanki.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/af/Race_Githyanki.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Githyanki\" title=\"Githyanki\">Githyanki</a>\n\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>A plain, unadorned note.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n\n<div class=\"bg