w-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Within the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Chest_of_Grateful_Words\" title=\"Chest of Grateful Words\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8a/Jeweled_Chest_A_Unfaded_Icon.webp/20px-Jeweled_Chest_A_Unfaded_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8a/Jeweled_Chest_A_Unfaded_Icon.webp/30px-Jeweled_Chest_A_Unfaded_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8a/Jeweled_Chest_A_Unfaded_Icon.webp/40px-Jeweled_Chest_A_Unfaded_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8a/Jeweled_Chest_A_Unfaded_Icon.webp/20px-Jeweled_Chest_A_Unfaded_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8a/Jeweled_Chest_A_Unfaded_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Chest_of_Grateful_Words\" title=\"Chest of Grateful Words\">Chest of Grateful Words</a></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<dl><dd><i>If Orpheus survives and did not become a mind flayer</i> (<details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">S_EPI_Letter_VossOrpheusAlive</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_EPI_Letter_VossOrpheusAlive\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_EPI_Letter_VossOrpheusAlive\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span>/<details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">147b3c9c-e054-4b85-ba0c-49ba6e4ee67c</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:147b3c9c-e054-4b85-ba0c-49ba6e4ee67c\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:147b3c9c-e054-4b85-ba0c-49ba6e4ee67c\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span>)</dd></dl>\n<p>[Githyanki script - tir'su - adorns one side of the page. The other is written in the common tongue.]\n</p><p><br>\nShe'lak,\n</p><p><br>\nThe Prince of the Comet shines ever-bright. Breath by breath, battle by battle, Vlaakith's death draws nearer. We have taken to the Astral Plane, slaughter all who must be slaughtered, and spread the Heir's Truth to every possible ear, willing and unwilling. Many githyanki have already taken up arms with us as Warriors of the Comet. Others have remained in their enclaves or travelled to crèches, dedicating themselves to Orpheus as scribes, spies, and slate-scholars.\n</p><p><br>\nBut our allies do not all call themselves Children of Gith. Zaerith Menyar-Ag-Gith, the githzerai's god-king, has requested an audience. There was a time I would have thought such a coalition unspeakable. But Orpheus has spoken: 'If Vlaakith is to fall, mayhaps the two skies must again be made one.'\n</p><p><br>\nVoss, Revrykal t'Orpheus, Knight of the Comet.\n</p><p><br>\n</p>\n<dl><dd><i>If Orpheus dies, or survives as a mind flayer</i> (<details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">S_EPI_Letter_VossOrpheusDead</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_EPI_Letter_VossOrpheusDead\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_EPI_Letter_VossOrpheusDead\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span>/<details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">418411e0-6e20-4911-9e1c-b6f240fb7cd8</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:418411e0-6e20-4911-9e1c-b6f240fb7cd8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:418411e0-6e20-4911-9e1c-b6f240fb7cd8\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span>)</dd></dl>\n<p>[Githyanki script - tir'su - adorns one side of the page. The other is written in the common tongue.]\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>She'lak,\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>Orpheus may not be with us, but the Comet shines ever-bright. Breath by breath, battle by battle, Vlaakith's death draws nearer. I have taken to the Astral Plane, slaughter all who must be slaughtered, and spread the Heir's Truth to every possible ear, willing and unwilling. Many githyanki have already taken up arms as Warriors of the Comet. Others have remained in their enclaves or travelled to crèches, dedicating themselves to our cause as scribes, spies, and slate-scholars.\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>But our allies do not all call themselves Children of Gith. Zaerith Menyar-Ag-Gith, the githzerai's god-king, has requested an audience. There was a time I would have thought such a coalition unspeakable. But with the githzerai at our side, not even the full force of the kith'raki could stop us. If Vlaakith is to fall, perhaps the two skies must again be made one.\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>Voss, Revrykal t'Orpheus, Knight of the Comet\n</p>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Contingent on Voss supporting the player character in the final battle. <sup class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">[<a href=\"/wiki/bg3wiki:Verification\" title=\"bg3wiki:Verification\"><span aria-label=\"can you get this and the ...\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"bg3wiki-help-tooltip\"><i>verify</i></span></a>]</sup></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714234327\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.076 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.080 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3104/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 71701/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 28049/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.021/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1202071/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   64.464      1 -total\n 98.80%   63.691      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n 53.27%   34.342     10 Template:Icon_text\n 49.99%   32.223     35 Template:Trim\n 27.13%   17.488      8 Template:Uid\n 22.96%   14.804      1 Template:PageSeo\n 22.92%   14.776      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 19.18%   12.364      4 Template:Icon_link\n 17.31%   11.160      2 Template:CharLink\n 15.79%   10.178     12 Template:Ifempty\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:30052-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714234327 and revision id 368472. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}